WEBVTT

00:00:00.008 --> 00:00:08.257
We’ll start with method chaining, which connects DataFrame operations into one readable sequence.

00:00:08.257 --> 00:00:13.462
Then we’ll create pivot tables, reshape wide data into long data, extract features from dates,

00:00:13.462 --> 00:00:22.927
calculate rolling summaries, map category codes, inspect joins, and finally wrap a Pandas workflow inside a function.

00:00:23.573 --> 00:00:30.009
These are practical patterns you will see in reporting, data preparation, and production analytics code.
